  "prefLabel": "Med 403.05 Letters of Good Standing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Med 403.05 Letters of Good Standing. Licensees who wish to request a license verification or a letter of good standing from the board shall complete and submit a “Letter of Good Standing Request Form”, revised 11/2019, to the board along with the $20.00 fee.\n\nSource. #12972, eff 1-10-20",
